\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid10572083\charrsid7154849 1/ C\'e1c \'f0\u7889\'3fi t\'fd\u7907\'3fng thu\u7897\'3fc c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f h\u7841\'3f t\u7847\'3fng \'f0\'fd\u7901\'3fng s\u7855\'3ft c\u7911\'3fa ng\'e0nh \'f0\'fd\u7901\'3fng s\u7855
\'3ft bao g\u7891\'3fm : h\u7879\'3f th\u7889\'3fng c\u7847\'3fu, \'f0\'fd\u7901\'3fng, h\u7847\'3fm (c\u7847\'3fu, h\u7847\'3fm, \'f0\'fd\u7901\'3fng ch\'ednh tuy\u7871\'3fn, \'f0\'fd\u7901\'3fng trong ga, ghi, c\u7847\'3fu c\u7841\'3fn, k\'e8, t\'fd
\u7901\'3fng ch\u7855\'3fn, c\u7889\'3fng c\'e1c lo\u7841\'3fi, thi\u7871\'3ft b\u7883\'3f c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh d\u7885\'3fc tuy\u7871\'3fn nh\'fd bi\u7875\'3fn b\'e1o, c\u7885\'3fc, m\u7889\'3fc ch\u7881\'3f d\u7851\'3fn, c\'e1c g\'e1c ch\u7855
\'3fn \'f0\'fd\u7901\'3fng ngang), c\'e1c thi\u7871\'3ft b\u7883\'3f thu\u7897\'3fc h\u7879\'3f th\u7889\'3fng th\'f4ng tin t\'edn hi\u7879\'3fu (nh\'fd t\'edn hi\u7879\'3fu ra v\'e0o ga, h\u7879\'3f th\u7889\'3fng c\'e1p t\'edn hi\u7879\'3fu, thi\u7871
\'3ft b\u7883\'3f ch\u7889\'3fng ch\u7871\'3f ch\u7841\'3fy t\'e0u, h\u7879\'3f th\u7889\'3fng \'f0i\u7873\'3fu khi\u7875\'3fn v\'e0 kh\u7889\'3fng ch\u7871\'3f t\u7853\'3fp trung, h\u7879\'3f th\u7889\'3fng c\'e1c \'f0\'fd\u7901\'3fng truy\u7873\'3fn th
\'f4ng tin t\'edn hi\u7879\'3fu, m\'e1y m\'f3c thi\u7871\'3ft b\u7883\'3f truy\u7873\'3fn t\u7843\'3fi, h\u7879\'3f th\u7889\'3fng ngu\u7891\'3fn, c\'e1c tr\u7841\'3fm t\u7893\'3fng \'f0\'e0i), h\u7879\'3f th\u7889\'3fng ki\u7871\'3fn tr\'fac nh\'e0 ga.

\par 2/ S\u7917\'3fa ch\u7919\'3fa c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f h\u7841\'3f t\u7847\'3fng \'f0\'fd\u7901\'3fng s\u7855\'3ft bao g\u7891\'3fm : S\u7917\'3fa ch\u7919\'3fa th\'fd\u7901\'3fng xuy\'ean (duy tu) v\'e0 s\u7917\'3fa ch\u7919\'3fa l\u7899\'3fn.
\par 3/ C\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f qu\u7843\'3fn l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40 \ltrch\fcs0 \f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid10572083\charrsid7154849 \'fd c}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid10572083\charrsid7154849 \'f5 s\u7903\'3f h\u7841\'3f t\u7847\'3f
ng \'f0\'fd\u7901\'3fng s\u7855\'3ft th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f h\u7841\'3fch to\'e1n s\u7921\'3f nghi\u7879\'3fp kinh t\u7871\'3f; kinh ph\'ed ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng do Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc \'f0\'e0
i th\u7885\'3f; c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f n\'e0y khi th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn c\'e1c kh\u7889\'3fi l\'fd\u7907\'3fng s\u7917\'3fa ch\u7919\'3fa c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f h\u7841\'3f t\u7847\'3fng \'f0\'fd\u7901\'3fng s\u7855\'3ft \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc mi
\u7877\'3fn n\u7897\'3fp thu\u7871\'3f doanh thu, thu\u7871\'3f l\u7907\'3fi t\u7913\'3fc v\'e0 thu s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng v\u7889\'3fn.
\par 4/ Doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp khai th\'e1c v\u7853\'3fn t\u7843\'3fi \'f0\'fd\u7901\'3fng s\u7855\'3ft c\'f3 ngh\u297\'3fa v\u7909\'3f tr\'edch n\u7897\'3fp v\'e0o Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc  m\u7897\'3ft kho\u7843\'3fn ti\u7873\'3fn thu\'ea s
\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f h\u7841\'3f t\u7847\'3fng \'f0\'fd\u7901\'3fng s\u7855\'3ft. Kho\u7843\'3fn ti\u7873\'3fn n\'e0y \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc t\'ednh theo t\u7927\'3f l\u7879\'3f % tr\'ean doanh thu v\u7853\'3fn t\u7843\'3fi th\u7921\'3f
c hi\u7879\'3fn, do B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh x\'e1c \'f0\u7883\'3fnh h\'e0ng n\'e3m. Trong n\'e3m 1995, t\u7927\'3f l\u7879\'3f n\'e0y \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh l\'e0 10%.
\par }\pard \ltrpar\qc \li0\ri0\widctlpar\tx1251\tx1971\tx2691\tx3411\tx4131\tx4851\tx5571\tx6291\tx7011\tx7731\tx8451\tx9171\tx9891\tx10611\tx11331\wrapdefault\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9988668 {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\ai\af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
